+ * import it from Talk.tsx. Own every visual decision here: palette,
+ * typography, spacing, borders, shadows, and card/button treatments. The
+ * scene kit ships none of these on purpose.
+ *
+ * Style the active-state hooks so the current step reads clearly:
+ *   [data-presentation-progress-dot][data-presentation-active="true"]
+ *   [data-presentation-toc-item][data-presentation-active="true"]
+ * And give the attribution link real styling:
+ *   [data-presentation-attribution]
+ *
+ * The kit lays out header/body/footer, fits the stage, and pins attribution
+ * bottom-right; it leaves the table-of-contents breakpoint to you. Keep the
+ * ToC to wide viewports (adjust the width to suit this design).
+ */
+
